    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} \\text { Molefraction of solute }\\left(\\mathrm{X}_2\\right) \\text { in aqueous solution } & =\\frac{\\mathrm{m}}{\\mathrm{m}+\\frac{1000}{18}} \\\\ & =\\frac{5.2}{5.2+\\frac{1000}{18}}=0.09\\end{aligned}$",
